<title>USA: ITT Sheraton sued by Sumitomo/John Hancock.</title>
<headline>ITT Sheraton sued by Sumitomo/John Hancock.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The ITT Sheraton Corp, a unit of ITT Corp, has been sued for fraud and mismanagement of a Washington D.C. hotel owned by a partnership of John Hancock Mutual Life Insurance Co and Sumitomo Life Realty (NY) Inc.</p>
<p>In papers filed Friday in the U.S. District Court in Delaware, the partnership, 2660 Woodley Road Joint Venture, seeks unspecified triple damages and a court order terminating ITT Sheraton's management contract for the Sheraton Washington Hotel.</p>
</text>
